algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: Matrix A of size n × m
Output: (is_rank_1, counterexample)

ref_diffs[j] ← A[0,j] - A[0,0] for j = 0,...,m-1
for i = 1 to n-1:
    for j = 1 to m-1:
        if A[i,j] - A[i,0] ≠ ref_diffs[j]:
            return (False, (i, j))
return (True, None)

Complexity: O(nm) time, O(m) space
